    "text": "The cards JB Hi-Fi gave away with Pokémon TCG purchases, the same ones Best Buy gave in the United States: Xerneas with the Mega Evolution logo, in Australia and New Zealand from 26 September 2025, then in New Zealand Luxray with the Perfect Order logo, Delphox with the Chaos Rising logo from its launch on 22 May 2026, and Armarouge with the \"What's Your Favorite?\" logo for the 30th anniversary of Pokémon. In Australia, Mr Toys and Toymate gave Luxray and Delphox.",
